    <div class="prose">
      <p>Matcha Sous began behind the caf&eacute; bar. I could never get that silky microfoam on my own, not reliably, and never in a hurry, and making the same drink again and again made the variable impossible to ignore: the mixing.</p>
      <p>We designed Sous to support that one step. You still choose the tea, measure the water and define the finished drink. Sous brings them together and refines the texture, hands-free.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

